  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Logistical Support to the Norwegian Election Observer Group to the EU Election Observation Mission (EU EOM) to Sao Tom&#xE9; and Principe 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Commission/FPl 3 appointed IOM with the logistical and administrative implementation of the EU EOM Sao Tom&#xE9; and Principe 2022. In accordance with the terms of reference of the EU EOM Sao Tom&#xE9; and Principe 2022, IOM will provide logistical and administrative support to one Norwegian Election Observer (non-EU), who is a member of the EU EOM observer group; for this purpose, a separate agreement is signed between IOM and the Norwegian Foundation - Norwegian Refugee Council (NRC).</narrative>
  </description>
